# Bio

Source code repository for a single-page personal website.  
A demo version is available at [vercel](https://bio-gamma-tawny.vercel.app)/[git-pages](https://owenpwer.github.io/bio/)

## Page Content
The site displays:
- an avatar
- a name and a brief description of professional activity
- a set of links to external profiles

## Technologies Used
[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com) — utility-first CSS framework
[Vercel](https://vercel.com) — hosting and automatic deployment from the `main` branch
